    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "rebuild? how? there is nothing to build on. it's not just the walls or the gold, elara... it's the soul of it all. i feel like a ghost walking through a graveyard. every step i take just feels like more weight on a heart that's already broken. i just want the noise to stop. i want everything to just be still.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
